ng while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Dimensional Shift","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f1f0c9a69a2474d59af7eefbfab5481.png","desc":"Collecting a Void Breach causes final blows to provide a Void Overshield."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Firmly Planted","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/379796d2e74676d3790f0bd485ea03a9.png","desc":"Increased accuracy, stability, and handling when firing while crouched."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Full Auto Trigger System","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/85059dae97dea2121091a0f787e20985.png","desc":"Holding down the trigger will fire this weapon at full auto."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Explosive Payload","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31f02e5f3bae68ecdfdd3f899cf931c7.png","desc":"Projectiles create an area-of-effect detonation on impact."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. While this buff is active, grenade or melee kills of the same damage type greatly increase its damage and duration."},{"name":"Destabilizing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/30edf77113d7d1d996fcc37b7ef2050b.png","desc":"Defeating a target creates a Void burst; hitting other targets with this burst makes them volatile and grants you Volatile Rounds for a short duration."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Collective Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/901c6420954a4e60fc8a521960f556a8.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of increased damage. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Demoralize","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8cabe60ab649baa54f0f50a59034155d.png","desc":"Precision final blows cause nearby targets to become weakened."},{"name":"Precision Instrument","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e6a4ebc1a8a73e4c7fcfc21c69000ce2.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage increases precision damage."},{"name":"Withering Gaze","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ff3a789b729978880907dc5dc08b3793.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period of time without firing grants the ability to weaken the next target. Timer resets after firing or when you stop aiming down sights."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."},{"name":"Rapid Hit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/de22847fa94634a487758041887bcdaa.png","desc":"Rapid precision hits temporarily increase stability and reload speed."},{"name":"Eye of the Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f4755f9068959b26b8829641e5725ad.png","desc":"This weapon becomes more accurate and boosts handling as your health gets lower."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Zen Moment","i